comment.narrative:
The Project Knowledge Management Plan focuses activities in three main areas:
data collection in the pilot plots and in the fields of the project beneficiaries;
analysis and evaluation of technical reports and investment programmes;
conducting capacity building and knowledge dissemination activities, including the development of an appropriate methodologies

The project reports the achievement of the following key milestones (achieved with an incremental input from the project jointly with the UNCCD Focal Point team):
-	National LDN target setting;
-	Concept and Roadmap for the development the National Action Program to Combat Desertification;
-	LDN definition through amendments proposed for the Land Code.
